      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Generating sound\n\n`sound/oscillator` produces a waveform; `sound/output` sends it to the speakers. Wire mouseY through a `math/map` and the pitch slides as you move the cursor.\n\nThe big ellipse is just visual feedback for how loud it is.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
